OL,3,GNEWSAPublic inquiry to examine
OL,4,Awarehouse lorry fleet bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public inquiry is to examine a
OL,7,Flogistics firm's bid to operate a large
OL,8,Ffleet of lorries and trailers at its
OL,9,Fgiant warehouse base.
OL,11,FWhistl has applied to use 60 HGVs and
OL,12,F95 trailers at Astley Business Park in
OL,13,FTyldesley, Wigan, which has been dogged
OL,14,Fby noise complaints from local
OL,15,Fresidents.
OL,17,FThe office of the Traffic Commissioner
OL,18,Fsaid 131 individuals from 96 homes near
OL,19,Fto the giant warehouse complex had
OL,20,Fvalid objections.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
